{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226720","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226720","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422672001:1":{"text":"느껴져요... 강물과 당신의 영혼이... 핏줄이... 다시 이어졌어요...","source_cn":"我感觉到了……河流和你的灵魂……血脉……重新连接在了一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D84F9ED3E6C2B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422672002:0":{"text":"이제... 당신이 어디에 있든... 고향의 수맥이... 함께할 거예요...","source_cn":"从此……无论你前往何处……故乡的水脉都将与你相连……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE628D112AFDF517A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422672003:1":{"text":"감사합... 으윽!","source_cn":"多谢——呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8770756F832C4D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422672003":{"text":"감사합... 으윽!","source_cn":"多谢——呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8770756F832C4D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422672004:0":{"text":"네. 아직 통증이 남아 있지만... 괜찮습니다.","source_cn":"还好，只是还有点疼的感觉残留，已经没事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7904CEAF634660EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422672006:0":{"text":"이제 강의 시험은 끝난 모양이군요. 다음 시험은 무엇입니까?","source_cn":"那么，河川的考验已经结束，请告诉我下一项考验是什么吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87CA35404EAA429E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422672007:0":{"text":"지금은... 몸 상태가... 너무 안 좋아요.","source_cn":"你现在的身体状况……很、很糟糕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2BD455F186A495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422672008:0":{"text":"움직이지 말고... 푹 쉬어야 해요... 그렇지 않으면...","source_cn":"最好不要活动……要休息……否则……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CAC30D5C40E427D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422672009:0":{"text":"인듀어, 이대로는 자기 몸을 갉아먹는 것밖에 안 됩니다!","source_cn":"因度厄，你这样只是在伤害自己的身体！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE8AF7C5B794B46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422672010:0":{"text":"지금 상태로는 시험은커녕 평범한 전투도 견디기 힘듭니다!","source_cn":"你现在别说接受考验了，就算普通的战斗恐怕也举步维艰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28D590D439B4ABD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422672011:0":{"text":"감사합니다. 여러분의 호의는 잘 알겠습니다만...","source_cn":"谢谢你们。你们的好意我非常明白，只是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC08D640AF3C9BDAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422672012:0":{"text":"이런 고통은 죄악화에 비하면 아무것도 아닙니다.","source_cn":"只是这份痛苦，对于孽化来说，并不算什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F30048820ACEB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422672013:0":{"text":"이렇게 버티는 이유가 도대체...","source_cn":"你……这样强撑——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624435297ABC67D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422672014:0":{"text":"셀로클랜드에는 지금 이 순간에도 저주와 죄악화의 고통에 무너지는 이들이 많습니다.","source_cn":"萨洛克兰的许多人，此刻仍然在诅咒与孽化交织的苦痛中沉沦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B8E1E321C19DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422672015:0":{"text":"제가 서두른다면 조금이라도 더 많은 사람들을 구할 수 있겠지요.","source_cn":"如果我能提前一些，那么就会有越多人得到拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74C88870B3F3575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422672016:0":{"text":"방금 전, 휴윈 양이 고향의 수맥과 제가 연결되었다고 하셨지요.","source_cn":"刚刚，伊温小姐说，故乡的水脉从此与我相连。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8904B97EF7462B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422672017:0":{"text":"하지만, 어쩌면 염치가 없을지도 모르지만... 고향이라는 말에 제일 먼저 떠오르는 것은 역시나 셀로클랜드였습니다.","source_cn":"但，或许是我不识抬举吧……在提到故乡的时候，我眼前浮现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD877223502F8275E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422672018:0":{"text":"셀로클랜드를 구하고, 바꾸고 싶습니다. 그게 바로 제가 지금 여기 서 있는 이유기도 합니다.","source_cn":"我想要去拯救它，改变它。这也是我站在此处的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33F026EE0AB4D280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422672019:0":{"text":"그러니 다음 시험에 대해 알려주십시오, 에이론.","source_cn":"所以，请告诉我下一项考验是什么吧，埃隆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1946C2EC5FBCD4BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422672020:0":{"text":"...고집스럽군요. 미리 말씀드리지만 다음 시험은 더 힘들 겁니다.","source_cn":"……真是固执。我先警告你，接下来的考验并不会更容易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5BF68A967D752F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422672021:0":{"text":"그렇다면 더더욱 시간 낭비를 할 수 없겠군요. 갑시다.","source_cn":"那就更不能浪费时间了，走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBC972EEAD3ADC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"괜찮아?","source_cn":"没事吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x001F3B5A66AE48B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"괜찮아?","female":"괜찮아?","variant_male_record_index":"249356","variant_female_record_index":"249357","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422672005:0":{"text":"그 순간에는 아팠지만 이제는 괜찮습니다. 곧 회복할 수 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"当时是有些疼，但现在已经好多了，很快就可以恢复正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE2B4150A2AC4D22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"많이 아파?","source_cn":"很疼吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC78B0B0B34595814","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"많이 아파?","female":"많이 아파?","variant_male_record_index":"72998","variant_female_record_index":"72999","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}